    FINRA OTC Transparency Non-ATS Monthly Summary. Monthly non-ATS over-the-counter trading
    volume by security: the shares and trades executed off-exchange by OTC market makers, outside
    of dark pools. It complements the weekly ATS feed to cover total off-exchange activity.
    """

    @property
    def end_time(self) -> datetime.datetime:
        """
        Publication date of the report, as reported by FINRA for that month.
        This is when LEAN delivers the data point.
        """
